# Installers are no longer tracked in this repo, so there are no LFS rules.
#
# They used to be, via Git LFS. That silently handed a 130-byte pointer file
# to anyone cloning without git-lfs or using GitHub's "Download ZIP" — with no
# error to indicate the download was not an installer. Build with
# `npm run release:win` and ship the artifact from release/ directly.
